    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Six-arm brass chandelier with pleated fabric shades on curved arms, glass rods and drops between the arms, a turned central column, a long downrod and a ceiling rose. The top and bottom views confirm all six sockets, the central bowl and the underside finial. Title corrected: the shades are pleated fabric and the crystal is in the rods and drops.",
    "limitations": [
      "Shades do not emit light by default; add emitters at the six sockets.",
      "Not rigged: the arms and downrod are fixed.",
      "Glass rods use simple transparency rather than full dispersion."
    ],
